{
    "title": "Stunt Bike Extreme",
    "description": "Stunt Bike Extreme is the ultimate motocross racing game with awesome jump ramps and fast jumping tracks. You start with a cool dirt bike that can handle the jumps in the tracks, but later on can try the tracks with more agile trial bike and other bikes like old time classic motorcycle, and even a mini monkey bike. The tracks have been designed with keen eye on making it a cinematic experience to the player.\r\n\r\n\u2b50AWESOME TRIAL LEVELS\u2b50\r\nEach level will not just challenge your bike skills but also your strategic thinking. Not everyone can complete our levels, especially with 3 stars and reach our most Trial levels ever!\r\n\r\n\u2b50AWESOME GRAPHICS\u2b50\r\nThe craziest 3D graphics you've ever seen come together with perfectly designed levels to form an insane riding experience.\r\n\r\n\u2b50UPGRADE FOR SUCCESS \u2b50\r\nUpgrade your bike abilities; improve your \u2018on track\u2019 performance and your bike\u2019s appearance with the most hardcore equipment available.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Stunt Bike Extreme is the ultimate motocross racing game with awesome jump ramps and fast jumping tracks. You start with a cool dirt bike that can handle the jumps in the tracks, but later on can try the tracks with more agile trial bike and other bikes like old time classic motorcycle, and even a mini monkey bike. The tracks have been designed with keen eye on making it a cinematic experience to the player.<br><br>\u2b50AWESOME TRIAL LEVELS\u2b50<br>Each level will not just challenge your bike skills but also your strategic thinking. Not everyone can complete our levels, especially with 3 stars and reach our most Trial levels ever!<br><br>\u2b50AWESOME GRAPHICS\u2b50<br>The craziest 3D graphics you&#39;ve ever seen come together with perfectly designed levels to form an insane riding experience.<br><br>\u2b50UPGRADE FOR SUCCESS \u2b50<br>Upgrade your bike abilities; improve your \u2018on track\u2019 performance and your bike\u2019s appearance with the most hardcore equipment available.",
